    <tags>hardware-monitor temperature cpu gpu sensors system-monitor windows admin</tags>
    <summary>Hardware monitor for Windows 11: processor, graphics, memory and drive sensors.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
Thermalyn reads processor, graphics, memory and drive sensors and keeps a 15-minute history.

* Compact, Balanced and Detailed views that follow the window size
* English and French interface, switched at runtime
* Dark and light themes, customizable accent and threshold colours
* Per-component warm and critical thresholds, with a history of every crossing
* Sensors selected by exact name, never inferred: an unidentified reading is reported as absent
  rather than approximated

It runs entirely offline. No account, no telemetry, no background service.

Processor temperature and power draw need the PawnIO driver, which the installer sets up.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/NoaSansH/Thermalyn/releases/tag/v1.0.3</releaseNotes>
